<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:10:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>AlexForbes 资产达到 450 亿美元后出现更多增长</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/alexforbes-sees-more-growth-after-assets-hit-45-billion</link><description>南非最大的商业退休基金管理机构上半年管理资产增加了 13%，预计今年剩余时间将保持这一速度。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/alexforbes-sees-more-growth-after-assets-hit-45-billion'&gt;AlexForbes 资产达到 450 亿美元后出现更多增长&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：AlexForbes Sees More Growth After Assets Hit $45 Billion&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/alexforbes-sees-more-growth-after-assets-hit-45-billion</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:28:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>土耳其计划降低里拉存款税以支持货币</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-plans-lower-taxes-on-lira-deposits-to-support-currency</link><description>据知情人士透露，在官方外汇储备大幅下降后，土耳其正计划降低里拉存款利息税，以支持对该货币的需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-plans-lower-taxes-on-lira-deposits-to-support-currency'&gt;土耳其计划降低里拉存款税以支持货币&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Turkey Plans Lower Taxes on Lira Deposits to Support Currency&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-plans-lower-taxes-on-lira-deposits-to-support-currency</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:41:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</link><description>尽管人们对人工智能繁荣和相关工业金属需求的持久性仍存疑虑，但铜价从 11 个月低点上涨逾 3%，追随科技股的涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals'&gt;由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Rebounds From Lowest This Year as Volatility Grips Metals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:01:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印度航空首席执行官寻求今年削减 6.5 亿美元成本</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</link><description>据知情人士透露，印度航空有限公司希望本财年削减 600 亿卢比（6.5 亿美元）的成本，其新任首席执行官概述了振兴塔塔集团旗下航空公司的举措，该航空公司在截至 3 月份的财年中出现了创纪录的亏损。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year'&gt;印度航空首席执行官寻求今年削减 6.5 亿美元成本&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Air India’s New CEO Announces Efficiency Measures to Pare Costs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:20:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>